    "detailed_description": "Welcome to the revolutionary world of Unity programming education with 'U-Sharp.' U-Sharp is the first-of-its-kind game designed to make learning Unity and C-Sharp fun and engaging.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview:</h2>U-Sharp offers a unique blend of education and entertainment. Explore a virtual universe where your character must retrieve encrypted files from a hacked computer. Your mission: to modify code to solve themed challenges that range from the fundamental basics to advanced expertise.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677830/extras/69208726f49308f731e30da6417f655f.poster.avif?t=1727640273\" width=560 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677830/extras/69208726f49308f731e30da6417f655f.webm?t=1727640273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677830/extras/69208726f49308f731e30da6417f655f.mp4?t=1727640273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Master Unity and C-Sharp programming through hands-on, interactive gameplay.<br></li><li>Engage with captivating puzzles that promote problem-solving, logical thinking, and creativity.<br></li><li>A guided learning path ensures a smooth, barrier-free experience.<br></li><li>Mistakes are not failures; they are stepping stones to progress, thanks to clear feedback and enjoyable outcomes.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Be part of the Community:</h2>Join the Discord Server for updates and exchange with other learners and challenge seekers.<br><br>Whether you're new to programming or looking to enhance your Unity skills, U-Sharp offers an inclusive, entertaining, and unique learning adventure. Dive into this virtual world and emerge as a Unity programming expert. Learning has never been this exciting!",
    "about_the_game": "Welcome to the revolutionary world of Unity programming education with 'U-Sharp.' U-Sharp is the first-of-its-kind game designed to make learning Unity and C-Sharp fun and engaging.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview:</h2>U-Sharp offers a unique blend of education and entertainment. Explore a virtual universe where your character must retrieve encrypted files from a hacked computer. Your mission: to modify code to solve themed challenges that range from the fundamental basics to advanced expertise.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677830/extras/69208726f49308f731e30da6417f655f.poster.avif?t=1727640273\" width=560 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677830/extras/69208726f49308f731e30da6417f655f.webm?t=1727640273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2677830/extras/69208726f49308f731e30da6417f655f.mp4?t=1727640273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Master Unity and C-Sharp programming through hands-on, interactive gameplay.<br></li><li>Engage with captivating puzzles that promote problem-solving, logical thinking, and creativity.<br></li><li>A guided learning path ensures a smooth, barrier-free experience.<br></li><li>Mistakes are not failures; they are stepping stones to progress, thanks to clear feedback and enjoyable outcomes.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Be part of the Community:</h2>Join the Discord Server for updates and exchange with other learners and challenge seekers.<br><br>Whether you're new to programming or looking to enhance your Unity skills, U-Sharp offers an inclusive, entertaining, and unique learning adventure. Dive into this virtual world and emerge as a Unity programming expert. Learning has never been this exciting!",
